+
+## Local repairs
+
+- Excluded generated `output/` evidence from Prettier. Application source remains checked, and existing hash-bound evidence bytes were preserved. Corrected three existing formatting failures in editor settings, the local operations snapshot and an operations test; the snapshot's parsed JSON content is unchanged.
+- Moved the existing no-JavaScript navigation CSS into the document head's `noscript`. This repairs owned HTML conformance while retaining the tested no-JavaScript navigation.
