+Preexisting changes included `vnu-jar` and its lock/workspace configuration, Sentry server cancellation filtering and regressions, public-resource E2E coverage, the untracked strict HTML test, two authored Bee/Riddle blog source files and their publication receipts. These were preserved. Authored repairs above remain reviewable in the working tree. No commit, push, PR merge, production deployment/promotion, external message, account-setting change or unrelated secret change was performed during this verification.
