-      "requirements": "# Jest candidate validation — 2026-09-16\n\nThis is a historical validation record. The later Jest submission was rejected; see [the review remediation checklist](REVIEW_FEEDBACK.md) for the current submission hold and unresolved findings. These Simulator results do not establish that the manual review requirements pass.\n\nThe development candidate recorded below passed **16 / 16 Basic Launch checks** in the authenticated Jest Simulator, including recovered and newly initiated purchases.\n\n## Exact uploaded candidate\n\n- Version: `1.6.5-dev.26259142343`\n- Jest version ID: `01a0aa9e-3a99-72a4-bbd2-b0485f268d64`\n- ZIP: `Builds/PuzzlePunks_WebGL_JestLightweightDevBackend.1.6.5-dev.26259142343.zip`\n- State: ready, inactive development candidate\n- Jest Unity SDK: `2.10.0`\n- Receipt: `Builds/Reports/JestUploadReceipt.json`\n- [Open the exact candidate in Simulator](https://jest.com/developers/simulator?source=game&teamId=019f0e38-4b34-76fe-99ba-a8957c15295c&gameId=019f0e39-7bf3-70b2-92ac-6f67161af265&versionId=01a0aa9e-3a99-72a4-bbd2-b0485f268d64)\n\nThis build uses the Jest lightweight development profile and the development backend.\n\n## Simulator results\n\n- Basic Launch checklist: **16 / 16**.\n- Guest registration and the in-game platform registration flow pass.\n- Player identity, guest player data, `markGameLoaded()`, catalog retrieval, purchase initiation, automatic-popup suppression, and D1–D7 notification checks pass.\n- Level 1 was completed through gameplay; Level 2 unlocked and `first_milestone` passed.\n- Shop prices match the Jest catalog: Starter `$1.79`, Skin `$3.99`, Cyber `$7.99`.\n- Purchase cancellation and simulated internal-error paths return cleanly.\n- The seeded incomplete Cyber Pack recovered successfully. The backend granted `skin_matrix`, 1,600 gems, and `fu_no_interstitials`; the SDK activity log records `CompletePlatformPurchase` and its response at 16:57:05.\n- A new Starter Pack purchase completed successfully. The checkout used SKU `com.puzzle.starter` at `$1.79`; the backend granted 300 gems, `skin_bear`, one `spin_tile`, and `fu_no_interstitials`. The game displayed the reward and the balance reached 1,900 gems. The SDK activity log records `CompletePlatformPurchase` and its response at 17:10:03.\n- A later reload returned no incomplete purchases and did not issue another completion or backend grant, confirming completed purchases are not awarded twice.\n\n## Backend deployment\n\nCloud Run revision `g2-dev-backend-b1d63f3be5-00030-qcd` starts successfully and applies the Jest purchase migrations:\n\n- `20260827144744 JestPurchaseType`\n- `20260827144745 JestPurchases`\n\nCloud Logging contains one successful `cyber_pack` claim for the recovery and one successful `starter_pack` claim for the new checkout. The cumulative 1,900-gem balance confirms the recovered 1,600-gem award persisted before the 300-gem Starter award.\n\n## Client compatibility fix\n\nThe deployed Kinoa shop configuration does not currently provide `jest_product_id`. `WebGLBillingServiceWrapper` supplies the established Jest mapping when the optional value is absent:\n\n- `starter_pack` → `com.puzzle.starter`\n- `skin_deal_pack` → `com.puzzle.skin`\n- `cyber_pack` → `com.puzzle.cyber`\n\nThe fallback is used for catalog lookup and interrupted-purchase recovery. Focused Unity PlayMode billing tests pass: **19 passed, 0 failed**.\n\nBatch-mode Unity builds also skip VoxelBusters' editor-only settings search, preventing the prior test/build crash.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `evidence/simulator-basic-launch-16-of-16.png`\n- `evidence/simulator-starter-checkout.png`\n- `evidence/simulator-starter-reward.png`\n- `evidence/simulator-starter-balance-1900.png`\n- `evidence/simulator-sdk-activity-purchases.png`\n\n## References\n\n- [Pinned backend protocol](https://github.com/Dash-Games/GameTwo-server/blob/2f22b2fb133b30539d056e420f97a69f3ce1e1ed/common_libs/protocols/protobuf/game_one.proto)\n- [Jest payments and recovery](https://docs.jest.com/sdk/unity/payments)\n- [Jest launch checklist](https://docs.jest.com/launch-checklist)\n"
