l Safari checks were waived on 13 October 2026. The owner deferred final deployment and requested continued use of the current demo. Target LMS acceptance will follow the final rollout, once requested and access is granted.\n\nRun the database integration checks without retaining any fixture changes:\n\n```bash\nnode --env-file=.env scripts/database-query.js supabase/tests/operational_safeguards.sql\n```\n\nThe helper reads the local Supabase access token without printing it. This integration check always rolls back its fixture transaction.\n\nThe 11 October creative-area change has 33 passing Chromium/Firefox/WebKit TV and complete career-flow scenarios plus hosted WebKit evidence in `docs/CREATIVE-HIVE-AREAS.md`. Bee task declarations in `docs/development-tasks/*.json` are imported alongside the historical tracker, with the same receipt hash checks.\n"
